	(text_box "LM339 (Comparator):\nWhen both IN- and IN+ are both within the common-mode range:\na. If IN- > IN+ and the offset voltage, the output is low and the output transistor is sinking\ncurrent\nb. If IN- < IN+ and the offset voltage, the output is high impedance and the output transistor is\nnot conducting"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 135.89 53.34 0)
		(size 72.39 10.16)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
